feat(scope): short description under 72 chars

Longer explanation of what this feature does and why it's needed.
Explain the change in detail - what was added, why it matters,
and any important context for future readers.

Include relevant details:
- What was implemented
- Why this approach was chosen
- Any dependencies or prerequisites
- Testing approach

